@ net:cantina-greedo-battle
SwPeople_Text_Greedo_1::
	.string "GREEDO: Oota goota, kid?\p"
	.string "(Going somewhere?)\p"
	.string "(You came in on SOLO's freighter.\n"
	.string "JABBA wants his money.)\p"
	.string "(Maybe your companions can pay\n"
	.string "his debt!)$"

@ net:cantina-greedo-battle
SwPeople_Text_Greedo_2::
	.string "GREEDO: Koona t'chuta!\p"
	.string "(JABBA is going to hear about\n"
	.string "this!)$"

@ net:cantina-greedo-battle
SwPeople_Text_Greedo_3::
	.string "GREEDO: (Tell SOLO I'm waiting right\n"
	.string "here in this booth.)\p"
	.string "(And next time, I shoot first.)$"

@ person:bens-hut:002
SwPeople_Text_AYark002_1::
	.string "“Rrraaagh!”$"

@ person:bens-hut:002
SwPeople_Text_AYark002_2::
	.string "“...the hermit is under the clan's\n"
	.string "protection.”$"

@ person:tosche-station-power-station:005
SwPeople_Text_Fixer005_1::
	.string "“Power converters. You want them, you\n"
	.string "wait like everyone else.”$"

@ person:tosche-station-power-station:006
SwPeople_Text_StationHand006_1::
	.string "“Camie says Luke is off chasing\n"
	.string "another COMPANION. That boy.”$"

@ person:tosche-station:007
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller007_1::
	.string "“Meesa Jar Jar! Yousa going to\n"
	.string "Kashyyyk? Big trees. Bigger Wookiees.”$"

@ person:tosche-station:008
SwPeople_Text_Person008_1::
	.string "“Move along. Move along.”$"

@ person:tosche-station:009
SwPeople_Text_Person009_1::
	.string "“We are looking for two droids. Seen\n"
	.string "any?”$"

@ person:mos-eisley:010
SwPeople_Text_Person010_1::
	.string "“Docking Bay 94 is closed for an\n"
	.string "inspection. Imperial business.”$"

@ person:mos-eisley:011
SwPeople_Text_Person011_1::
	.string "“That Corellian freighter again. One\n"
	.string "day we will search it properly.”$"

@ person:mos-espa-podrace-arena:013
SwPeople_Text_Bookie013_1::
	.string "“Odds on Sebulba: nobody takes them.\n"
	.string "Odds on anyone else: nobody takes them\p"
	.string "either.”$"

@ person:mos-espa-podrace-arena:014
SwPeople_Text_PitDroid014_1::
	.string "“Bzzt. Engine three is on fire. That is\n"
	.string "normal.”$"

@ person:mos-espa-podrace-arena:015
SwPeople_Text_PodraceFan015_1::
	.string "“The Boonta Eve runs over the old\n"
	.string "Cycling Road. Hover-bikes only, now.”$"

@ person:mos-espa-podrace-arena:016
SwPeople_Text_Sebulba016_1::
	.string "“You race? No. You lose. Sebulba wins.\n"
	.string "Always.”$"

@ person:mos-espa-podrace-arena:016
SwPeople_Text_Sebulba016_2::
	.string "“Chuba! ...take the lens. Sebulba does\n"
	.string "not need to see you again.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:017
SwPeople_Text_Thug017_1::
	.string "“Nobody sees Jabba without an\n"
	.string "invitation. You have one? No?”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:018
SwPeople_Text_Thug018_1::
	.string "“The last visitor went down the\n"
	.string "trapdoor. Want to see it?”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:019
SwPeople_Text_Thug019_1::
	.string "“Jabba pays well. The ones who fail him\n"
	.string "pay better.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:020
SwPeople_Text_Thug020_1::
	.string "“Skiff duty tomorrow. Over the Dune\n"
	.string "Sea. I hate the Dune Sea.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:021
SwPeople_Text_BibFortunaSErrandDroid021_1::
	.string "“I was sent for spice. I got lost. I am\n"
	.string "always lost.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace:022
SwPeople_Text_JawaHopingToSellDroids022_1::
	.string "“Utinni! ...Jabba buys droids. Jabba\n"
	.string "does not pay for droids.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-throne-room:025
SwPeople_Text_BibFortuna025_1::
	.string "“De wanna wanga... my errand droid is\n"
	.string "lost again. Find it and I forget you\p"
	.string "were here.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-throne-room:026
SwPeople_Text_Gamorrean026_1::
	.string "“Hrrrnk.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-throne-room:027
SwPeople_Text_Gamorrean027_1::
	.string "“Hrrrnk! Hrrrnk!”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-throne-room:028
SwPeople_Text_SalaciousCrumb028_1::
	.string "“Hee hee hee hee!”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-throne-room:029
SwPeople_Text_Malakili029_1::
	.string "“He is only hungry. Step on the grate\n"
	.string "and you will see how hungry.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-barge-dock:031
SwPeople_Text_Weequay031_1::
	.string "“The sail barge does not leave. Neither\n"
	.string "do you, until we have fought.”$"

@ person:jabbas-palace-barge-dock:032
SwPeople_Text_BargeCrewman032_1::
	.string "“The Khetanna. Jabba has never sailed\n"
	.string "her past the pit. One day.”$"

@ person:kachirho:033
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller033_1::
	.string "“Yousa made it! Meesa going to Sullust\n"
	.string "next. Hot. Very hot.”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro:034
SwPeople_Text_WookieeElder034_1::
	.string "“Rrrawrgh. (The elder points up: the\n"
	.string "village has stood in these branches for\p"
	.string "a thousand years.)”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro:035
SwPeople_Text_Kirlocca035_1::
	.string "“Rrrrrgh!” (a challenge)$"

@ person:rwookrrorro:036
SwPeople_Text_Merumeru036_1::
	.string "“Wrrhhh.” (a quieter challenge)$"

@ person:rwookrrorro:037
SwPeople_Text_WookieeCub037_1::
	.string "“Rrr! (The cub wants to show you a seed\n"
	.string "it found.)”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro-chief-hut:038
SwPeople_Text_VillageChief038_1::
	.string "“Hrrrnnn. (The chief hands you a disc.)\n"
	.string "TM31 BRICK BREAK.”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro-chief-hut:039
SwPeople_Text_WookieeElder039_1::
	.string "“Rrawr. (The elder says the Empire\n"
	.string "takes Wookiees from the lowlands. Not\p"
	.string "from here. Not yet.)”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro-hut-1:041
SwPeople_Text_Wookiee041_1::
	.string "“Hrrn. (The bowcaster maker will trade\n"
	.string "his WROSEED for any TATOOINE\p"
	.string "companion.)”$"

@ person:rwookrrorro-hut-2:042
SwPeople_Text_Wookiee042_1::
	.string "“Rrrr. (The weaver shows you a Life Day\n"
	.string "robe.)”$"

@ person:inyusu-tor:044
SwPeople_Text_NienNunb044_1::
	.string "“I fly for anyone who pays and the\n"
	.string "Rebellion when nobody does. Dr. Tien's\p"
	.string "rock? The Empire took it an hour ago.”$"

@ person:pirin:045
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller045_1::
	.string "“Da hot springs! Meesa stayed in too\n"
	.string "long. Endor next, with da little bears.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-facility:046
SwPeople_Text_Tk421046_1::
	.string "“This is a restricted area. Drill time.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-facility:047
SwPeople_Text_Tk710047_1::
	.string "“The general says we train until the\n"
	.string "lava cools. It never cools.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-facility:049
SwPeople_Text_MiningDroid049_1::
	.string "“Collector arm four: jammed. Since the\n"
	.string "war. Nobody fixes anything.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-control:050
SwPeople_Text_Tanbris050_1::
	.string "“The old Separatist records are sealed.\n"
	.string "You will not see them. ...you saw them.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-control:051
SwPeople_Text_MiningDroid051_1::
	.string "“The holo-table plays the same seconds\n"
	.string "over and over. Two men. A river of fire.”$"

@ person:mustafar-mining-control:052
SwPeople_Text_RelicDooku052_1::
	.string "“A Separatist holocron, cracked. A\n"
	.string "voice: '...the Jedi are the true enemy, my\p"
	.string "young friend...' Count Dooku, dead these\n"
	.string "twenty years.”$"

@ person:endor-battlefield:053
SwPeople_Text_Tk585053_1::
	.string "“The walkers went down a month ago.\n"
	.string "Command has not sent a pickup.”$"

@ person:endor-battlefield:054
SwPeople_Text_Tk329054_1::
	.string "“Logs. On ropes. In trees. Nobody\n"
	.string "briefed us on logs.”$"

@ person:endor-battlefield:055
SwPeople_Text_EwokScout055_1::
	.string "“Yub nub! (The scout mimes a log\n"
	.string "swinging and a walker falling.)”$"

@ person:endor-battlefield:056
SwPeople_Text_Rex056_1::
	.string "“Captain Rex. Clone, retired,\n"
	.string "un-retired. I need what is in that\p"
	.string "bunker. Clear it and the elixir is\n"
	.string "yours.”$"

@ person:endor-battlefield-bunker:057
SwPeople_Text_Tk902057_1::
	.string "“Last one on guard. The scanner table\n"
	.string "stays. ...fine, take the scanner table.”$"

@ person:bright-tree:058
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller058_1::
	.string "“Da little bears like Jar Jar! Yousa\n"
	.string "going up to da cloud city? Meesa first.”$"

@ person:cloud-city:059
SwPeople_Text_Lobot059_1::
	.string "“...(Lobot blinks.) The north skybridge\n"
	.string "is open to you. The refinery has\p"
	.string "visitors it did not invite.”$"

@ person:cloud-city:060
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller060_1::
	.string "“So high! Jar Jar no look down. Dagobah\n"
	.string "next. Swampy. Like home.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery:061
SwPeople_Text_UgnaughtForeman061_1::
	.string "“Snrk. Thugs at the tanks. We are\n"
	.string "workers, not fighters. You look like a\p"
	.string "fighter.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery:062
SwPeople_Text_Thug062_1::
	.string "“Tibanna gas sells for more than spice\n"
	.string "this year. Jabba wants it all.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery:063
SwPeople_Text_Thug063_1::
	.string "“The bald guy with the headset keeps\n"
	.string "watching us. Creepy.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery-interior:064
SwPeople_Text_Ugnaught064_1::
	.string "“The siphon is on tank six. He is on tank\n"
	.string "six too.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery-interior:065
SwPeople_Text_Thug065_1::
	.string "“Last tank. Last thug. Let us make this\n"
	.string "quick.”$"

@ person:tibanna-refinery-annex:066
SwPeople_Text_UgnaughtForeman066_1::
	.string "“The freezing rig is new. Carbon. The\n"
	.string "baron wants it tested on something big.\p"
	.string "Not on me.”$"

@ person:nijedha:069
SwPeople_Text_Pilgrim069_1::
	.string "“I walked from the pad. The water was\n"
	.string "cold. I am happy.”$"

@ person:nijedha:070
SwPeople_Text_Tk114070_1::
	.string "“Kyber shipments are Imperial property.\n"
	.string "So is this street.”$"

@ person:nijedha:071
SwPeople_Text_KyberTrader071_1::
	.string "“Crystals, light or dark. I do not ask\n"
	.string "what you do with them.”$"

@ person:nijedha-temple-of-the-kyber:072
SwPeople_Text_ChirrutMwe072_1::
	.string "“I am one with the Force and the Force\n"
	.string "is with me. You? You are with your\p"
	.string "companions. Close enough. Take this\n"
	.string "spoon; it bends.”$"

@ person:nijedha-temple-of-the-kyber:073
SwPeople_Text_BazeMalbus073_1::
	.string "“He talks. I shoot. Today nobody\n"
	.string "shoots. Enjoy it.”$"

@ person:nijedha-guardians-quarters:075
SwPeople_Text_Guardian075_1::
	.string "“Chirrut says the temple will fall within\n"
	.string "the decade. Baze says he says that\p"
	.string "every decade.”$"

@ person:nijedha-hostel:076
SwPeople_Text_Pilgrim076_1::
	.string "“The hostel floor is stone. My knees are\n"
	.string "old. The Force is patient; I am not.”$"

@ person:nijedha-hostel:077
SwPeople_Text_Innkeeper077_1::
	.string "“Beds are free for pilgrims. You are a\n"
	.string "pilgrim now.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:079
SwPeople_Text_RebelSurveyor079_1::
	.string "“Major Derlin. One of my scouts walked\n"
	.string "north and did not walk back. Find him\p"
	.string "and the general will hear of it.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:080
SwPeople_Text_TauntaunHandler080_1::
	.string "“They smell worse inside than out. Still\n"
	.string "beats walking.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:081
SwPeople_Text_Cal081_1::
	.string "“Cal Alder. Survey team. The cold keeps\n"
	.string "you honest.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:082
SwPeople_Text_Toryn082_1::
	.string "“Toryn Farr. If the general picks this\n"
	.string "rock for a base, I want a transfer.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:083
SwPeople_Text_Tigran083_1::
	.string "“Tigran Jamiro. There is something in\n"
	.string "the cave with claws. We named it after\p"
	.string "the scream it makes.”$"

@ person:hoth-tundra:084
SwPeople_Text_LostScout084_1::
	.string "“...I saw it. White. Tall. I am not going\n"
	.string "back in there. Take this; I will not need\p"
	.string "ice to remember.”$"

@ person:hoth-survey-outpost:085
SwPeople_Text_RebelSurveyor085_1::
	.string "“General Rieekan. You brought my scout\n"
	.string "home. If this planet becomes our base, I\p"
	.string "will remember who walked it first. TM07,\n"
	.string "for the weather.”$"

@ person:hoth-survey-outpost:086
SwPeople_Text_RebelTechnician086_1::
	.string "“Shield generator survey. Power survey.\n"
	.string "Where-to-put-the-door survey. Hoth\p"
	.string "has a lot of nothing to survey.”$"

@ person:hoth-tauntaun-shelter:087
SwPeople_Text_TauntaunHandler087_1::
	.string "“Two tauntauns and a cold. The cold is\n"
	.string "winning.”$"

@ person:tipoca-city-cloning-hall:088
SwPeople_Text_KaminoanScientist088_1::
	.string "“The Empire ended the contract. The\n"
	.string "pods are dark. One subject was never\p"
	.string "recorded. It left on its own. We call it\n"
	.string "the prototype.”$"

@ person:tipoca-city-cloning-hall:089
SwPeople_Text_Ct2271089_1::
	.string "“Cadet. The commander says the drill is\n"
	.string "the drill. Begin.”$"

@ person:tipoca-city-cloning-hall:090
SwPeople_Text_Ct4040090_1::
	.string "“Last batch. No more after us. Make it\n"
	.string "count.”$"

@ person:tipoca-city-cloning-hall:091
SwPeople_Text_Cody091_1::
	.string "“Commander Cody. Was. The Empire has no\n"
	.string "use for old clones, so I keep the last\p"
	.string "cadets sharp. You beat them. Take this\n"
	.string "band; it held my helmet on at Utapau.”$"

@ person:yavin-4:093
SwPeople_Text_Wedge093_1::
	.string "“Wedge Antilles. Red Two, when there is\n"
	.string "a Red Squadron. The tower has a shuttle\p"
	.string "for anywhere the Rebellion needs eyes.”$"

@ person:yavin-4:094
SwPeople_Text_Janson094_1::
	.string "“Wes Janson. I fly with Wedge. I also\n"
	.string "keep Wedge from flying into things.”$"

@ person:yavin-4-launch-tower-1f:095
SwPeople_Text_Hobbie095_1::
	.string "“Hobbie Klivian. Shuttle duty today:\n"
	.string "Hoth, Kamino, and wherever the swamp\p"
	.string "pilot refuses to go.”$"

@ person:yavin-4-launch-tower-1f:096
SwPeople_Text_Zev096_1::
	.string "“Zev Senesca. Fuel count is low. The\n"
	.string "Empire knows it too.”$"

@ person:yavin-4-launch-tower-2f:097
SwPeople_Text_Dak097_1::
	.string "“Dak Ralter. Youngest pilot on the\n"
	.string "base. I feel like I could take on the\p"
	.string "whole Empire myself.”$"

@ person:dagobah:098
SwPeople_Text_JarJarTraveller098_1::
	.string "“Last stop for Jar Jar. Yousa go on.\n"
	.string "Take dis: a pearl from Otoh Gunga. Meesa\p"
	.string "going home.”$"

@ person:cave-of-evil-b1f:099
SwPeople_Text_VisionGrievous099_1::
	.string "“A clatter of four arms and a cough.\n"
	.string "'General Kenobi... you are a bold one.'\p"
	.string "Then nothing. The cave shows what the\n"
	.string "Jedi feared.”$"

@ person:mortis-gate-exterior:100
SwPeople_Text_Ahsoka100_1::
	.string "“You should not be able to see me. Then\n"
	.string "again, I should not be here. Mortis\p"
	.string "keeps what the Force sends it. Go\n"
	.string "carefully.”$"

@ person:bestine-organa-tower-3f:101
SwPeople_Text_C3po101_1::
	.string "“Oh! A visitor for the Senator. I am\n"
	.string "C-3PO, human-cyborg relations. Do mind\p"
	.string "the StarNAV prototypes; they are\n"
	.string "frightfully fragile.”$"

@ person:bestine-organa-tower-2f:102
SwPeople_Text_R2D2102_1::
	.string "“Bwee-oop! (The astromech is plugged\n"
	.string "into the StarNAV bench. It sounds\p"
	.string "pleased with itself.)”$"

@ person:death-star-hangar:103
SwPeople_Text_Piett103_1::
	.string "“Captain Piett. This deck is secure. ...it\n"
	.string "was secure.”$"

@ person:death-star-hangar:104
SwPeople_Text_RebelInfiltrator104_1::
	.string "“K-2SO. Reprogrammed Imperial droid.\n"
	.string "The odds of you reaching the command\p"
	.string "deck are low. I will say them out loud as\n"
	.string "we go.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-1:105
SwPeople_Text_Tk411105_1::
	.string "“Deck 1. Nobody comes up here without a\n"
	.string "code.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-1:106
SwPeople_Text_Tk412106_1::
	.string "“The scaffolds are not rated for a\n"
	.string "fight. We fight anyway.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-1:107
SwPeople_Text_Motti107_1::
	.string "“Admiral Motti. This station will be the\n"
	.string "ultimate power in the galaxy. You are a\p"
	.string "rounding error.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-2:108
SwPeople_Text_Tk227108_1::
	.string "“Deck 2. Nobody comes up here without a\n"
	.string "code.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-2:109
SwPeople_Text_Tk228109_1::
	.string "“The scaffolds are not rated for a\n"
	.string "fight. We fight anyway.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-2:110
SwPeople_Text_Tagge110_1::
	.string "“General Tagge. Construction is behind\n"
	.string "schedule. You are not helping.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-3:111
SwPeople_Text_Tk651111_1::
	.string "“Deck 3. Nobody comes up here without a\n"
	.string "code.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-3:112
SwPeople_Text_Tk652112_1::
	.string "“The scaffolds are not rated for a\n"
	.string "fight. We fight anyway.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-3:113
SwPeople_Text_Ozzel113_1::
	.string "“Admiral Ozzel. Clumsy of you to come\n"
	.string "this far. Clumsier of me to let you.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-4:114
SwPeople_Text_Tk880114_1::
	.string "“Deck 4. Nobody comes up here without a\n"
	.string "code.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-4:115
SwPeople_Text_Tk881115_1::
	.string "“The scaffolds are not rated for a\n"
	.string "fight. We fight anyway.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-4:116
SwPeople_Text_Needa116_1::
	.string "“Captain Needa. I take full\n"
	.string "responsibility for this deck.\p"
	.string "Apparently that means fighting you.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-5:117
SwPeople_Text_Jir117_1::
	.string "“Colonel Yularen's staff. No further.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-5:118
SwPeople_Text_Daine118_1::
	.string "“The Director is in conference. With the\n"
	.string "Emperor. You will wait. ...you will not\p"
	.string "wait.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-5:119
SwPeople_Text_Tk001119_1::
	.string "“First trooper on the station. Last one\n"
	.string "you meet.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-5:120
SwPeople_Text_Krennic120_1::
	.string "“Director Krennic. We stand here amidst\n"
	.string "my achievement, not yours. ...get out.\p"
	.string "Before Lord Vader hears of this.”$"

@ person:death-star-ds-5:121
SwPeople_Text_Palpatine121_1::
	.string "“(A hologram, hooded.) 'Director. The\n"
	.string "station will be ready. See that it is.'\p"
	.string "The image flickers out before it\n"
	.string "notices you.”$"

@ person:asteroid-spire-hangar:122
SwPeople_Text_Pilot122_1::
	.string "“Strap in.”$"

@ person:dagobah-hangar:123
SwPeople_Text_Pilot123_1::
	.string "“Strap in.”$"

